```console
$ scherzo-cloud invitation decline --help
Decline an invitation

Usage: scherzo-cloud invitation decline [OPTIONS] --yes <INVITATION>

Arguments:
  <INVITATION>  Exact invitation ID

Options:
      --capability-file <PATH|->  Read an email invitation capability from a protected file or explicit stdin
      --yes                       Confirm invitation decline
      --json                      Print the invitation result as JSON
      --allow-insecure-http       Allow this command's Scherzo Cloud requests over insecure HTTP connections
  -h, --help                      Print help

```
